<title>UK: France Telecom sets 200 mln Sfr bond.</title>
<headline>France Telecom sets 200 mln Sfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANCE TELECOM</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    10.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.20    PAY DATE   S10.MAR.97</p>
<p>							 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
